      <title>FSD里程碑：马斯克预告“边开车边发信息”，特斯拉自动驾驶新纪元？</title>
      <link>https://johhhhnny.github.io/TeslaDaily/posts/20251106-fsd%E9%87%8C%E7%A8%8B%E7%A2%91%E9%A9%AC%E6%96%AF%E5%85%8B%E9%A2%84%E5%91%8A%E8%BE%B9%E5%BC%80%E8%BD%A6%E8%BE%B9%E5%8F%91%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E7%89%B9%E6%96%AF%E6%8B%89%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E9%A9%BE%E9%A9%B6%E6%96%B0%E7%BA%AA%E5%85%83/</link>
